@startuml UC-05: Thực hiện bài kiểm tra
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 5

actor "Ứng viên" as Candidate
boundary "Giao diện bài kiểm tra" as ExamUI
control "QuestionController" as QuestionController
control "QuestionService" as QuestionService
control "ExaminationRepository" as ExamRepo
control "ExamQuestionRepository" as ExamQuestionRepo
entity "ExaminationEntity" as ExaminationEntity
entity "ExamQuestionEntity" as ExamQuestionEntity

Candidate -> ExamUI: Truy cập link bài kiểm tra
ExamUI -> QuestionController: GET /question/examinations/:id

QuestionController -> QuestionService: getExaminationDetail(examinationId)
activate QuestionService

QuestionService -> ExamRepo: findOne({ examinationId })\nrelations: ['examQuestions', 'examQuestions.question']
activate ExamRepo
ExamRepo -> ExaminationEntity: <<ExaminationEntity>>
activate ExaminationEntity
ExaminationEntity --> ExamRepo: ExaminationEntity
deactivate ExaminationEntity
ExamRepo --> QuestionService: ExaminationEntity
deactivate ExamRepo

QuestionService --> QuestionController: ExaminationDetail\n{ examinationId, status, questions }
deactivate QuestionService

QuestionController --> ExamUI: 200 OK\nExaminationDetail
ExamUI -> Candidate: Hiển thị danh sách câu hỏi

Candidate -> ExamUI: Nhập câu trả lời cho từng câu hỏi
Candidate -> ExamUI: Nhấn "Nộp bài"

ExamUI -> QuestionController: POST /question/examinations/:id/submit\n{ answers: { examQuestionId: { answerText } } }

QuestionController -> QuestionService: submitExamination(examinationId, submitDto)
activate QuestionService

QuestionService -> ExamRepo: findOne({ examinationId })
activate ExamRepo
ExamRepo -> ExaminationEntity: <<ExaminationEntity>>
activate ExaminationEntity
ExaminationEntity --> ExamRepo: ExaminationEntity
deactivate ExaminationEntity
ExamRepo --> QuestionService: ExaminationEntity
deactivate ExamRepo

QuestionService -> ExamQuestionRepo: find({ examinationId })\nrelations: ['question']
activate ExamQuestionRepo
ExamQuestionRepo -> ExamQuestionEntity: <<ExamQuestionEntity>>
activate ExamQuestionEntity
ExamQuestionEntity --> ExamQuestionRepo: ExamQuestionEntity[]
deactivate ExamQuestionEntity
ExamQuestionRepo --> QuestionService: ExamQuestionEntity[]
deactivate ExamQuestionRepo

QuestionService -> QuestionService: Initialize totalScore = 0

loop [Cho mỗi câu trả lời]
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: Find examQuestion by examQuestionId
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examQuestion.answerText = answerText
    
    alt [Chưa có score/reason]
        QuestionService -> QuestionService: gradeAnswerWithAI(question, answerText)
        QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examQuestion.score = aiResult.score
        QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examQuestion.reason = aiResult.reason
    else [Đã có score/reason]
        QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examQuestion.score = providedScore
        QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examQuestion.reason = providedReason
    end
    
    QuestionService -> QuestionService: totalScore += examQuestion.score
end

QuestionService -> ExamQuestionRepo: save(examQuestions)
activate ExamQuestionRepo
ExamQuestionRepo -> ExamQuestionEntity: <<ExamQuestionEntity>>
activate ExamQuestionEntity
ExamQuestionEntity --> ExamQuestionRepo: ExamQuestionEntity[]
deactivate ExamQuestionEntity
ExamQuestionRepo --> QuestionService: void
deactivate ExamQuestionRepo

QuestionService -> QuestionService: Calculate averageScore = totalScore / examQuestions.length

QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examination.status = 'completed'
QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examination.submittedAt = new Date()
QuestionService -> QuestionService: Set examination.totalScore = averageScore

QuestionService -> ExamRepo: save(examination)
activate ExamRepo
ExamRepo -> ExaminationEntity: <<ExaminationEntity>>
activate ExaminationEntity
ExaminationEntity --> ExamRepo: ExaminationEntity
deactivate ExaminationEntity
ExamRepo --> QuestionService: ExaminationEntity
deactivate ExamRepo

QuestionService --> QuestionController: ExaminationDetail\n{ examinationId, status: 'completed', totalScore }
deactivate QuestionService

QuestionController --> ExamUI: 200 OK\nExaminationDetail
ExamUI -> Candidate: Hiển thị kết quả: "Đã nộp bài thành công"\n"Điểm số: {totalScore}"

@enduml

